    guidance captured on 15 September 2026. This is an explanation of the captured text, not a determination
    of contemporary individual eligibility.'
  limitations:
  - Independent experimental research, not an official DWP document, benefits advice, a calculation
    or an individual entitlement decision. All authored meanings and dependencies require specialist
    review.
  - The broad labels JSA and ESA do not establish a claimant’s regime. This profile explains the
    listed DMG legacy regimes; New Style JSA/ESA, UC and PIP are routed to ADM by 12016. Those ADM
    bodies are not acquired. Ask for regime/date and fresh authoritative checks before applying
    guidance to a person.
  - The payability statement at 12003 is scoped by the list in 12002. It cannot replace
    benefit-specific rules or establish that entitlement always survives imprisonment.
